CORRESPONDING SOURCE (GPL-2.0 section 3 / GPL-3.0 section 6)

Every component above is installed as an unmodified Alpine Linux package.
Alpine publishes the corresponding source and build recipes at:

  https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports

Run `apk info -a <package>` inside the image to resolve the exact version
shipped in a given tag.

The base image is Alpine Linux; its packages carry their own licenses
(musl MIT, busybox GPL-2.0-only).
